{"4232520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cape Protocol", "steam_appid": 4232520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rent Is Due</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been given a place to stay at a rebel base. There's only one catch,you have to pay for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take whatever work you can find to keep a roof over your head. Deliver cargo, hunt targets, salvage resources, fight hostile creatures, and take on dangerous jobs scattered across the galaxy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel Between Galaxies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is your ticket to the rest of the galaxy. Warp across vast distances to reach distant worlds, take on jobs, and return with your earnings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Gear, Dangerous Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not a superhero. You're simply equipped with technology that makes you considerably more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a powerful combat gauntlet for devastating punches, dual-wield guns to take down enemies at range, and rocket-powered equipment to fly through the air and reach places others can't.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work to Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete jobs and earn money to improve your weapons, equipment, and ship. Better gear lets you take on more dangerous and more profitable work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no grand heroic duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are just jobs to do, bills to pay, and a galaxy full of places to go.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rent Is Due</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been given a place to stay at a rebel base. There's only one catch,you have to pay for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take whatever work you can find to keep a roof over your head. Deliver cargo, hunt targets, salvage resources, fight hostile creatures, and take on dangerous jobs scattered across the galaxy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel Between Galaxies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is your ticket to the rest of the galaxy. Warp across vast distances to reach distant worlds, take on jobs, and return with your earnings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Gear, Dangerous Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not a superhero. You're simply equipped with technology that makes you considerably more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a powerful combat gauntlet for devastating punches, dual-wield guns to take down enemies at range, and rocket-powered equipment to fly through the air and reach places others can't.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work to Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete jobs and earn money to improve your weapons, equipment, and ship. Better gear lets you take on more dangerous and more profitable work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no grand heroic duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are just jobs to do, bills to pay, and a galaxy full of places to go.</strong></p>", "short_description": "The galaxy is your workplace. Rent is due. Take odd jobs across the galaxy to pay your rent at a rebel base. Warp to distant worlds, deliver cargo, hunt targets, fight enemies, and salvage valuable goods. Use powerful gauntlets, dual guns, and rocket-powered flight to get the job done.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232520/f23fe5497c4092d7978c404cede5ed36e2bda5fa/header.jpg?t=1788076581", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232520/64e6ac97756023f15fabf5d3904838238e8f42ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788076581", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4232520/64e6ac97756023f15fabf5d3904838238e8f42ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788076581", "web